OL,3,ARenee Good: Family of US woman killed
OL,4,Aby ICE agent sues Trump officials
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who was killed by
OL,7,Fan immigration agent in Minneapolis in
OL,8,FJanuary has announced two lawsuits
OL,9,Fagainst the US government and members
OL,10,Fof the Trump administration.
OL,12,FRenee Good, a US citizen, was shot to
OL,13,Fdeath by an Immigration and Customs
OL,14,FEnforcement (ICE) officer during a
OL,15,Fmajor immigration sweep. Millions
OL,16,Fwatched the video recorded of her
OL,17,Fkilling and residents of the Minnesota
OL,18,Fcity took to the streets to protest.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
