OL,3,ARenee Good: Family of US woman killed
OL,4,Aby ICE agent sues Trump officials
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne lawsuit blames the government for
OL,7,Fher death, claiming the operation
OL,8,Fcreated "an unprecedented environment
OL,9,Ffor state-sponsored violence", a lawyer
OL,10,Ffor the family said.
OL,12,FThe BBC has contacted the White House
OL,13,Fand Department of Homeland Security
OL,14,F(DHS).
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
